                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Rivet had feared a\nspeech about\nlimitless\nproduction.\nInstead you",
                                        "bring a complete\nset of parts and a\ncorrect answer.\nShe offers to",
                                        "oversee the test.\nPip starts to call\nher a miracle\nworker, then",
                                        "settles for the\nmore useful title:\nchief builder."
