                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The regulator can\nbe assembled from\nthe recovered\nparts. Future",
                                        "repairs need a\npolicy. Rivet can\nkeep a reserve for\nsudden faults or",
                                        "organize shared\nbatches with a\npublic parts\nledger. Neither\nneeds",
                                        "your ordinary\nsalvage today. The\nchoice concerns\nhow this network",
                                        "will be run."
